WEBVTT

00:09.080 --> 00:12.080
TEN YEARS AGO

00:21.120 --> 00:23.520
I'm useless.

00:25.800 --> 00:27.120
Other than hate,

00:28.640 --> 00:30.680
I am unable to do anything.

00:47.240 --> 00:51.200
JINGBEI MANSION

01:18.360 --> 01:20.280
You beggar.

01:24.080 --> 01:26.320
Who sent you here?

01:26.920 --> 01:29.040
100,000 souls of Qingzhou.

01:33.800 --> 01:35.240
You're from Qingzhou.

01:35.320 --> 01:38.640
You weren't burnt to death in Qingzhou.

01:39.880 --> 01:41.640
If I can't kill you today,

01:42.240 --> 01:43.440
Murong Jinghe,

01:44.480 --> 01:45.760
remember,

01:47.000 --> 01:50.440
the souls of Qingzhou
will send you to Hell.

01:57.520 --> 01:59.880
I am in hell.

02:07.840 --> 02:08.919
Look.

02:11.320 --> 02:12.160
Here.

02:13.800 --> 02:15.280
Here.

02:15.360 --> 02:16.880
And there.

02:19.280 --> 02:22.080
They are all your relatives.

02:23.320 --> 02:24.840
Can you see them?

02:32.440 --> 02:33.920
I originally intended

02:34.960 --> 02:37.320
to leave you with a whole body.

02:39.280 --> 02:41.640
But I have changed my mind.

02:43.800 --> 02:46.480
Why should I send you to hell

02:47.400 --> 02:49.040
to join your family?

02:54.800 --> 02:57.440
The lord ordered to let her go.

03:23.680 --> 03:25.200
It's not so easy

03:26.400 --> 03:28.120
to seek death.

03:29.600 --> 03:33.760
Living is a torture.

04:11.040 --> 04:13.160
You Qingzhou people

04:14.240 --> 04:16.959
broke my legs.

04:19.480 --> 04:21.920
I want you to know

04:23.400 --> 04:25.720
how it feels to be disabled.

05:01.520 --> 05:03.600
Father.

05:43.760 --> 05:44.720
My lord!

05:44.800 --> 05:45.760
Don't move!

05:49.040 --> 05:50.160
I live

05:51.800 --> 05:53.400
to kill you.

05:54.320 --> 05:56.080
You can't take revenge

05:57.480 --> 05:59.880
just with your hatred.

06:13.520 --> 06:14.640
Weibei Army.

06:16.000 --> 06:17.520
Murong Jinghe.

06:20.280 --> 06:22.200
Blood for blood.

06:22.280 --> 06:25.320
WEIBEI

08:02.160 --> 08:04.440
JINGBEI MANSION

08:05.240 --> 08:08.000
My lord, are you done?
Be quick. I can't hold on.

08:08.600 --> 08:11.360
Besides, it's embarrassing
if others see me like this.

08:17.920 --> 08:19.520
It's rare that you are in a good mood

08:19.600 --> 08:20.800
and want to paint me.

08:26.560 --> 08:28.760
This isn't me. It's Zhong Kui.

08:28.840 --> 08:30.360
I stood there for such a long time.

08:39.919 --> 08:41.120
It is Zhong Kui.

08:42.440 --> 08:43.280
What's wrong?

08:47.440 --> 08:48.640
You can use it to repel the ghosts.

08:49.760 --> 08:51.520
After we return to Zhaojing,

08:51.600 --> 08:53.440
there will be more and more
ghosts and demons.

08:54.400 --> 08:55.520
Ask Liu Zhong to come.

08:56.080 --> 08:57.240
Let's take care

08:57.320 --> 08:59.440
of the small ghost from last night first.

09:10.760 --> 09:11.880
Mei Lin, follow me.

09:12.560 --> 09:14.600
I will surely help you seek justice.

09:17.840 --> 09:19.600
Don't be afraid. Come.

09:22.760 --> 09:23.600
Prince Jing,

09:23.680 --> 09:24.760
you are being overly bullying.

09:24.840 --> 09:25.680
Bullying?

09:26.200 --> 09:28.160
Who is bullying? Who is bullied?

09:28.760 --> 09:30.040
He said it.

09:30.120 --> 09:31.480
Without the ceremony,
he wouldn't summon the Beauty.

09:32.600 --> 09:35.360
Yet he forced Mei Lin to stay
in his mansion last night.

09:35.440 --> 09:37.400
Great Yan falsely claims
to be a land of etiquette.

09:38.680 --> 09:41.960
My lord, last night, the one
who served you at the medicinal spring

09:42.040 --> 09:44.440
was the Xiyan Beauty?

09:46.440 --> 09:50.640
Miss, did I bully you?

09:53.440 --> 09:54.400
Your Highness,

09:55.680 --> 09:57.240
I served him willingly.

09:58.720 --> 09:59.800
Your Highness…

09:59.880 --> 10:01.320
She dares not to deny it.

10:02.400 --> 10:04.120
Don't be afraid. I'll take you away.

10:05.840 --> 10:07.040
Wait.

10:11.520 --> 10:13.160
On my way,

10:13.240 --> 10:15.360
without the Beauty as my company,

10:16.240 --> 10:19.800
I will feel quite bored.

10:19.880 --> 10:21.360
You haven't recovered
from your old injuries.

10:21.440 --> 10:23.280
Take care not to harm yourself.

10:27.840 --> 10:29.040
Please don't, my lord!

10:35.880 --> 10:41.360
I heard all Xiyan Beauties
could shoot arrows with a bow.

10:42.200 --> 10:44.800
How about the Beauty play a round with me?

10:44.880 --> 10:46.320
If she wins,

10:47.000 --> 10:49.360
to go or to stay,

10:49.920 --> 10:51.320
it's up to her.

10:53.440 --> 10:55.440
Okay. You're on.

11:05.400 --> 11:06.240
You,

11:07.960 --> 11:09.000
come here.

11:09.720 --> 11:11.640
- My lord.
- Demonstrate it for the Beauty.

11:14.000 --> 11:15.560
This jade pendant is the target.

11:15.640 --> 11:17.960
If you hit it, you'll be rewarded.

11:18.040 --> 11:19.680
If you miss it,

11:19.760 --> 11:20.760
you'll be punished.

11:20.840 --> 11:22.640
My lord, I don't dare.

11:22.720 --> 11:24.000
This is an order.

12:02.160 --> 12:03.440
I'm willing to accept punishment.

12:05.320 --> 12:06.360
Punishment.

12:07.320 --> 12:08.360
How to punish you?

12:09.240 --> 12:10.080
The punishment is your life.

12:11.200 --> 12:12.600
My lord. My lord, please spare my life.

12:12.680 --> 12:13.840
It is due to my lack of skill.

12:13.920 --> 12:15.960
Since it's due to your lack of skill,

12:16.040 --> 12:18.000
why should I keep you?

12:18.840 --> 12:20.080
Execution.

12:48.320 --> 12:49.760
Do you understand…

12:52.760 --> 12:54.520
the game rules now?

12:57.560 --> 13:00.080
She is mine. Who dares to touch her?

13:02.480 --> 13:03.840
Please calm your anger, my lord.

13:03.920 --> 13:06.400
It'll be inappropriate for us
to kill a Xiyan Beauty.

13:15.760 --> 13:16.720
Boring.

13:21.360 --> 13:22.480
Escort the princess back
to the relay station.

13:22.560 --> 13:24.040
Once the princess has rested and prepared,

13:24.120 --> 13:25.600
depart immediately for the capital.

13:26.120 --> 13:27.240
Yes.

13:40.120 --> 13:41.280
Eunuch Liu,

13:41.840 --> 13:42.840
look,

13:43.360 --> 13:45.200
that is the assassin you were looking for.

13:49.600 --> 13:52.200
JINGBEI RELAY STATION

13:59.760 --> 14:02.240
Mei Lin, he truly is a murderous demon.

14:02.960 --> 14:06.360
People all say the mass murderer general
killed 100,000 innocent people.

14:06.440 --> 14:07.520
I didn't believe it at first.

14:08.400 --> 14:10.320
Now it seems it was true.

14:10.840 --> 14:13.480
He could kill his guard at will.

14:13.560 --> 14:15.800
He is a demon who kills for fun.

14:18.160 --> 14:20.840
That man is the assassin from last night.

14:20.920 --> 14:22.000
My brother is right.

14:22.080 --> 14:23.480
We should stay away from him.

14:23.560 --> 14:24.920
Stay away from the mass murderer.

14:28.400 --> 14:29.560
Mei Lin,

14:30.320 --> 14:31.360
take this.

14:31.960 --> 14:34.720
If he bullies you again,
stab him with this.

14:35.560 --> 14:36.600
Your Highness.

14:36.680 --> 14:38.080
Stab him in the fourth rib.

14:38.160 --> 14:40.200
That's where the heart and lung are.

14:40.280 --> 14:41.680
A fatal blow in one strike.

14:44.320 --> 14:45.760
No.

14:45.840 --> 14:47.680
That's where the cows'
and sheep's heart and lung are.

14:47.760 --> 14:49.280
How about in humans?

14:50.880 --> 14:51.760
Here?

14:52.560 --> 14:53.760
No. Here?

14:55.280 --> 14:56.280
Or here?

14:56.800 --> 14:59.080
Your Highness, don't worry.

15:00.840 --> 15:02.080
I can protect myself.

15:02.920 --> 15:05.960
Forget it. If you kill him,
you can't survive.

15:08.800 --> 15:09.920
How about this?

15:10.000 --> 15:12.000
On our way to the capital,
you stay with me.

15:12.600 --> 15:15.160
I am the princess.
I can surely protect you.

15:19.200 --> 15:20.200
Thank you, Your Highness.

15:25.640 --> 15:26.800
You don't have to thank me.

15:41.480 --> 15:43.720
Since it's the Beauty
my third brother is interested in,

15:43.800 --> 15:44.920
you must investigate her thoroughly.

15:45.000 --> 15:45.880
EASTERN PALACE GARDEN

15:46.840 --> 15:48.440
Don't let him be fooled
by the Xiyan people.

15:49.240 --> 15:50.400
Rest assured, Your Highness.

15:50.480 --> 15:52.600
I've asked someone to investigate her.

16:02.720 --> 16:05.320
The butterfly is not a dirty thing.
Let it fly around here.

16:05.400 --> 16:07.760
This will do for one pot.
Boil water. Use pine charcoal.

16:07.840 --> 16:08.960
Yes.

16:23.920 --> 16:26.360
Your Highness, I have something to report.

16:27.120 --> 16:28.120
You've come just in time.

16:28.200 --> 16:30.720
This is Bamboo Cloud Dragon Tea.
Care to try this with me?

16:31.320 --> 16:32.360
Let's talk while drinking.

16:34.000 --> 16:35.160
Your Highness,

16:35.240 --> 16:36.640
I am but a simple warrior.

16:36.720 --> 16:38.920
I don't understand the art of tea.
I'm afraid…

16:40.840 --> 16:41.960
Mr. Zhang,

16:42.040 --> 16:43.880
I don't understand the art of tea, either.

16:44.400 --> 16:45.840
But I know

16:45.920 --> 16:48.200
only two tins of Cloud Dragon Tea
were produced this year.

16:48.800 --> 16:50.200
His Majesty bestowed

16:50.280 --> 16:52.880
one of them to His Highness.

16:53.680 --> 16:55.840
Good tea requires good water.

16:55.920 --> 16:59.120
The spring water from Tianshou Mountain
is filtered through bamboo conduits

16:59.200 --> 17:00.960
and then boiled with pine charcoal

17:01.040 --> 17:02.600
before it is used to brew tea.

17:02.680 --> 17:04.280
Pine charcoal, with its gentle
and slow-burning nature,

17:04.359 --> 17:05.880
is what allows the spring water
to be thoroughly heated.

17:05.960 --> 17:09.160
Mr. Zhang, please wait a moment.

17:17.720 --> 17:18.880
Your Highness,

17:18.960 --> 17:21.440
do you know the other tin
of Cloud Dragon Tea

17:21.520 --> 17:24.160
was sent to Prince Jing's Mansion
in Jingbei?

17:31.040 --> 17:32.200
Thank you, Your Highness.

17:35.960 --> 17:38.560
Zhang Yin,
you're getting bolder and bolder.

17:38.640 --> 17:40.680
You actually placed a spy
by my father's side.

17:41.600 --> 17:43.040
I wouldn't dare.

17:43.120 --> 17:47.120
The news comes from my scout in Jingbei.

17:58.680 --> 18:01.480
I've told you when you are handling
anything related to Prince Jing,

18:01.560 --> 18:03.360
you must be very cautious.

18:04.440 --> 18:07.240
Sir, hold it steady and drink.

18:09.480 --> 18:10.560
Your Highness,

18:11.240 --> 18:12.840
I know I was wrong.
I'm willing to accept punishment.

18:13.720 --> 18:16.360
I'm just worried that when Prince Jing
comes back to the capital,

18:16.440 --> 18:17.880
he might re-investigate
the old Qingzhou case.

18:17.960 --> 18:19.600
If he finds some new evidence…

18:20.200 --> 18:21.600
That's why I sent a scout.

18:23.960 --> 18:25.200
Did he find anything?

18:25.280 --> 18:26.680
I don't know.

18:26.760 --> 18:29.320
The scout was killed by Prince Jing.

18:33.880 --> 18:36.040
So, what do you want from me today?

18:36.640 --> 18:39.000
I hope Your Highness
can tell me what to do.

18:51.120 --> 18:53.200
This butterfly was flying just fine.

18:54.200 --> 18:56.120
If it hadn't acted rashly,

18:57.520 --> 18:59.800
it wouldn't have been caught by the wing.

19:07.760 --> 19:09.280
I don't get it.

19:09.800 --> 19:10.720
Please enlighten me.

19:12.000 --> 19:13.160
My third brother's act
of killing indicates

19:13.240 --> 19:16.200
that he believes the timing is not right
and that he lacks evidence.

19:18.160 --> 19:19.680
If you make a false move,

19:19.760 --> 19:21.240
you may face dire consequences.

19:21.320 --> 19:23.200
Mr. Zhang, remember that.

19:24.360 --> 19:26.680
I will keep your instructions in mind,
Your Highness.

19:29.360 --> 19:30.560
Since you are not familiar
with the art of tea,

19:30.640 --> 19:31.920
I shall not insist on your staying.

19:40.520 --> 19:41.840
I'll take my leave.

19:51.080 --> 19:52.520
A hard reputation to live up to.

19:53.120 --> 19:55.000
The Cloud Dragon Tea is nothing special.

19:58.120 --> 20:00.840
A disgraced prince actually
still receives favors.

20:00.920 --> 20:01.760
WANG QUAN

20:01.840 --> 20:04.200
It seems His Majesty now
is ready to forgive Prince Jing.

20:04.920 --> 20:06.760
My father still favors my third brother.

20:06.840 --> 20:09.240
There can be two tins of Cloud Dragon Tea.

20:09.320 --> 20:11.840
But there can be
only one Crown Prince in Great Yan.

20:11.920 --> 20:13.440
Your Highness is the true long incarnate.

20:13.520 --> 20:15.080
No matter what,

20:15.160 --> 20:18.480
the position of the Crown Prince
cannot possibly go to a prince

20:18.560 --> 20:21.080
who massacred civilians.

20:27.000 --> 20:30.400
I heard the peace-making princess
was Mr. Yue Qin's sister.

20:30.480 --> 20:31.920
Marriage alliance with the Xiyan princess.

20:32.000 --> 20:33.720
We will enjoy peace from now on.

20:33.800 --> 20:35.040
It seems there will be no more wars.

20:35.640 --> 20:37.640
Mr. Yue Qin's sister
must be very beautiful.

20:45.680 --> 20:46.840
Come here.

20:46.920 --> 20:49.680
The Beauties behind the carriage
are also so beautiful.

20:49.760 --> 20:50.800
Yeah.

20:51.960 --> 20:54.040
I heard the wedding envoy this time
was Prince Jing.

20:55.760 --> 20:57.040
The former General Weibei.

20:57.120 --> 20:58.360
That mass murderer general.

20:58.440 --> 20:59.280
Exactly.

21:00.560 --> 21:02.000
Has His Majesty forgiven him?

21:02.080 --> 21:03.920
The mass murderer is unfit
to be the wedding envoy.

21:07.000 --> 21:08.440
He certainly doesn't deserve it.

21:22.720 --> 21:25.920
A crow perches on a withered tree

21:26.000 --> 21:28.920
The pale moon at the second watch
Shines on decayed bones

21:29.000 --> 21:30.240
Troops enter the city by candlelight…

21:30.320 --> 21:31.920
- What's that?
- I don't know.

21:32.000 --> 21:34.840
Surveying the land
Turned into scorched earth

21:34.920 --> 21:38.600
A disabled guide leads the way

21:38.680 --> 21:42.360
The people look around anxiously

21:42.440 --> 21:45.920
Injustice cries out
To the nine heavens for redress

21:46.000 --> 21:49.680
Summoning 100,000 lost souls
To kill the mass murderer

21:49.760 --> 21:52.920
A crow perches on a withered tree

21:53.000 --> 21:56.040
The pale moon at the second watch
Shines on decayed bones

21:56.120 --> 21:59.120
Troops enter the city by candlelight

21:59.200 --> 22:02.200
Surveying the land
Turned into scorched earth

22:02.280 --> 22:05.440
A disabled guide leads the way

22:06.040 --> 22:09.600
The people look around anxiously

22:09.680 --> 22:13.360
Injustice cries out
To the nine heavens for redress

22:13.440 --> 22:16.720
- Summoning 100,000 lost souls to kill
- The people did not forget the grudge.

22:16.800 --> 22:19.080
How could my father forget it?

22:29.200 --> 22:31.600
Kill the mass murderer!

22:31.680 --> 22:34.200
Avenge the 100,000 wronged souls
of Qingzhou.

22:34.280 --> 22:35.560
Blood for blood!

22:35.640 --> 22:38.560
Kill him! Kill him!

22:41.360 --> 22:42.560
Blood for blood!

22:43.560 --> 22:48.040
Kill him! Kill him!

23:14.320 --> 23:15.600
Who dares to curse again?

23:15.680 --> 23:17.160
- A life for a life!
- Qingyan.

23:19.440 --> 23:21.520
Kill him!

23:37.480 --> 23:38.960
Whoever does it again

23:39.760 --> 23:42.800
will be buried with the Qingzhou people.

23:59.200 --> 24:00.640
WEIBEI

24:06.840 --> 24:08.880
WEIBEI

24:18.000 --> 24:20.720
Enough. Don't blow things
out of proportion.

24:20.800 --> 24:21.680
Yes.

24:24.920 --> 24:26.400
Go. Be quick.

24:28.400 --> 24:30.160
My lord, they are the ones
who sang the nursery rhyme.

24:34.960 --> 24:38.640
Who taught you that nursery rhyme?

24:41.000 --> 24:44.960
I will teach you a more interesting one.

24:48.680 --> 24:52.440
One or two jin of wine
Without getting drunk

24:53.080 --> 24:56.440
Listening to tunes until the third
Or fourth watch without feeling tired

24:58.080 --> 25:02.080
Being a ghost and knowing
All the tricks of ghosts

25:03.520 --> 25:07.280
The Ghost General, perfect in every way

25:16.240 --> 25:17.760
Well?

25:17.840 --> 25:21.040
I'm giving you less than him?

25:21.120 --> 25:24.440
He gave us five sticks
of candy-coated haws.

25:27.640 --> 25:28.760
This can buy

25:28.840 --> 25:31.040
100 sticks of candy-coated haws.

25:31.120 --> 25:32.080
Go ahead.

25:32.720 --> 25:34.440
Sing the new one loudly.

25:35.280 --> 25:37.640
Let the entire Zhaojing know

25:38.280 --> 25:40.280
I, the Ghost General,

25:41.000 --> 25:42.280
is back.

25:48.080 --> 25:51.320
One or two jin of wine
Without getting drunk

25:51.400 --> 25:53.960
Listening to tunes until the third
Or fourth watch without feeling tired

25:54.040 --> 25:57.880
Being a ghost and knowing
All the tricks of ghosts

25:57.960 --> 26:01.720
The Ghost General, perfect in every way…

26:02.720 --> 26:04.240
The Ghost General?

26:05.560 --> 26:08.720
He'd rather be a ghost than be a man.

26:12.880 --> 26:15.280
The Ghost General, perfect in every way

26:43.120 --> 26:44.400
YANMING PALACE

27:04.720 --> 27:05.640
Thank you, Father.

27:11.080 --> 27:12.360
Jinghe,

27:12.880 --> 27:15.520
I've sent you to Jingbei for ten years.

27:16.400 --> 27:17.960
Do you harbor any resentment?

27:28.560 --> 27:29.680
Father.

27:30.320 --> 27:32.600
In the past, I was too eager
for quick success

27:32.680 --> 27:34.080
and committed grave errors,

27:34.160 --> 27:36.600
failing to live up
to your earnest care and protection.

27:36.680 --> 27:38.840
You volunteered to escort
the marriage delegation.

27:38.920 --> 27:40.640
I thought you had come to your senses.

27:42.200 --> 27:44.280
But you scattered paper money
during the wedding procession in Jingbei.

27:44.360 --> 27:46.520
Could it be that you harbored
private resentment

27:46.600 --> 27:48.360
and intended to sabotage
the marriage alliance?

27:50.480 --> 27:51.680
Father,

27:52.560 --> 27:54.640
if I truly intended to sabotage
the marriage alliance,

27:54.720 --> 27:56.920
there would be plenty
of covert means to do so.

27:57.000 --> 27:58.680
Why would I make such a public spectacle,

27:58.760 --> 28:00.640
giving the censors ammunition

28:00.720 --> 28:01.600
to file complaints against me?

28:01.680 --> 28:03.360
Then you were venting personal resentment.

28:03.440 --> 28:06.800
I wouldn't dare disrupt your grand plans.

28:08.480 --> 28:09.360
Over these years

28:09.440 --> 28:12.120
of dealing with Xiyan,
I have come to understand

28:12.200 --> 28:15.400
that their king
is extremely patient and cunning.

28:15.480 --> 28:17.640
How do we know they aren't using
the marriage alliance

28:17.720 --> 28:20.040
as a chance to recuperate and regroup?

28:20.760 --> 28:22.640
Therefore, in my view,

28:22.720 --> 28:24.720
we must make a public example of them,

28:24.800 --> 28:26.520
so that Xiyan understands that agreeing

28:26.600 --> 28:27.920
to the marriage alliance

28:28.000 --> 28:30.360
is a great favor we are granting them.

28:30.440 --> 28:31.960
If they dare cause trouble again,

28:32.040 --> 28:33.400
there will be no leniency.

28:34.600 --> 28:38.080
I'm very happy that you understand
all this.

28:40.360 --> 28:42.920
Don't make things difficult
for Xiyan people,

28:43.000 --> 28:44.640
especially Princess Zigu.

28:44.720 --> 28:47.480
Her brother is still a hostage
in Great Yan.

28:47.560 --> 28:50.560
Do not let this create a rift
between our countries.

28:50.640 --> 28:53.440
Otherwise, the marriage alliance
will be meaningless.

28:54.400 --> 28:57.520
Yes. I will follow your instructions.

28:58.320 --> 28:59.560
Jinghe,

28:59.640 --> 29:01.280
allowing you to return to the capital

29:01.360 --> 29:03.280
has already invited criticism.

29:03.360 --> 29:05.720
The nursery rhyme reflects public opinion.

29:05.800 --> 29:06.920
The public opinion is like water.

29:07.000 --> 29:09.600
Water can carry a boat,
but it can also capsize it.

29:12.640 --> 29:13.680
I understand.

29:19.280 --> 29:20.840
In the 14th year of the Zhaoming era,

29:22.440 --> 29:24.680
you volunteered to reclaim Qingzhou.

29:24.760 --> 29:26.600
You suffered in Qingzhou

29:26.680 --> 29:28.760
and was unable to see your mother
for the last time.

29:28.840 --> 29:31.680
I know that you harbor regret
and resentment in your heart.

29:31.760 --> 29:32.720
- Father…
- Jinghe,

29:34.960 --> 29:36.040
your return to the capital this time

29:36.800 --> 29:38.200
is still about the old matters
of Qingzhou, right?

29:41.560 --> 29:44.480
Father, I wouldn't dare.

29:45.200 --> 29:48.440
Father, you've said
that the events of Qingzhou

29:49.320 --> 29:50.600
should never be spoken of again.

29:55.040 --> 29:57.880
COURT OF STATE CEREMONIAL

29:59.760 --> 30:00.600
Look.

30:00.680 --> 30:02.720
Zhaojing is so prosperous, so beautiful.

30:02.800 --> 30:04.680
I've never seen these plants in Xiyan.

30:05.360 --> 30:06.280
I just saw someone

30:06.360 --> 30:07.600
selling Whitening Pills
at the street corner.

30:14.040 --> 30:17.480
When entering the city yesterday,
Your Highness must be frightened.

30:17.560 --> 30:19.120
Upon hearing of this, His Majesty

30:19.200 --> 30:23.200
has ordered Imperial Healer Zhang
to prepare a soothing potion for you.

30:24.680 --> 30:25.680
Well…

30:25.760 --> 30:28.560
Do I have to meet His Majesty
in the palace at once?

30:31.320 --> 30:34.360
Today is the late Empress'
death anniversary.

30:34.440 --> 30:37.600
I'm afraid His Majesty will have no time
to meet Your Highness.

30:38.120 --> 30:40.840
Besides, according to the customs
of Great Yan,

30:40.920 --> 30:43.560
joyous and mourning events
should not coincide.

30:44.280 --> 30:47.120
His Majesty specifically instructed me.

30:47.200 --> 30:49.320
Please forgive us.

30:50.680 --> 30:52.960
Given that Your Highness endured
a long and tiring journey,

30:53.040 --> 30:54.760
please first rest
at the Court of State Ceremonial

30:55.440 --> 30:59.440
and only enter the palace to meet
His Majesty during the alliance banquet.

31:08.640 --> 31:11.160
Mr. Yue Qin is also staying
in the Court of State Ceremonial,

31:11.240 --> 31:13.160
not far away from your place.

31:13.760 --> 31:14.640
Well,

31:16.000 --> 31:17.840
can I see my brother very soon?

31:19.680 --> 31:22.200
I will now return to the palace to report.

31:26.200 --> 31:28.760
Chagu, I'll meet my brother soon.

31:30.240 --> 31:31.440
Great Yan places great importance
on etiquette.

31:31.520 --> 31:32.880
There are many dignitaries in Zhaojing.

31:32.960 --> 31:34.840
We must be even more cautious
in our actions from now on.

31:34.920 --> 31:35.960
After we become dignitaries
through marriage alliance,

31:36.040 --> 31:37.120
no one will dare to bully us.

31:37.200 --> 31:38.880
I heard there was no Crown Princess
in the Eastern Palace.

31:38.960 --> 31:40.520
The Crown Prince doesn't fancy
just any woman.

31:40.600 --> 31:42.280
Ssh, stop talking.

32:08.280 --> 32:09.720
Your Highness,
His Majesty has given an order

32:09.800 --> 32:11.640
prohibiting Your Highness
from paying respects to Empress Dejia.

32:16.840 --> 32:18.600
RONG'AN PALACE

32:26.120 --> 32:27.800
TEN YEARS AGO

32:27.880 --> 32:29.440
RONG'AN PALACE

33:35.760 --> 33:39.640
MEMORIAL TO EMPRESS DEJIA OF GREAT YAN

34:24.679 --> 34:25.719
Mother,

34:28.880 --> 34:33.000
I have come back alive.

34:40.239 --> 34:44.440
MEMORIAL TO EMPRESS DEJIA OF GREAT YAN

34:56.800 --> 34:57.840
Rebel!

34:57.920 --> 34:59.520
How dare you wear a wedding gown?

35:01.280 --> 35:02.400
Jinghe,

35:02.480 --> 35:04.000
today is the day of Mother's burial.

35:04.080 --> 35:05.760
How can you wear a wedding gown?

35:07.600 --> 35:09.240
What's there to celebrate?

35:11.240 --> 35:13.800
Jinghe, you scoundrel!

35:14.960 --> 35:16.680
Great Yan reclaiming Qingzhou

35:16.760 --> 35:18.560
was not for the sake
of reclaiming an empty city.

35:20.080 --> 35:22.320
You show no remorse
and are disobedient and disrespectful.

35:22.400 --> 35:23.880
You are unworthy to pay respects
to the Empress.

35:23.960 --> 35:25.040
Drag him out.

36:04.240 --> 36:06.760
PRINCE JING'S MANSION

36:07.480 --> 36:09.880
Why did Prince Jing confine us
as soon as he came back to the capital?

36:09.960 --> 36:11.520
He has killed too many people.

36:11.600 --> 36:13.320
He must fear the vengeful souls
of the wronged coming for him.

36:19.520 --> 36:21.080
You are not ordinary people.

36:22.760 --> 36:23.840
Speak.

36:23.920 --> 36:25.360
Who sent you here?

36:26.000 --> 36:27.120
I'll tell you.

36:27.920 --> 36:29.640
I am a guard at the West Suburbs Barracks.

36:29.720 --> 36:32.400
Our superiors ordered us to incite
the people to kill the mass murderer.

36:32.480 --> 36:34.160
Your superiors are mass murderers.

36:35.680 --> 36:36.720
It's been ten years,

36:37.320 --> 36:39.920
and you're still using the same means
to harm Prince Jing.

37:17.160 --> 37:19.280
WEIBEI

37:21.040 --> 37:23.040
My lord, it's been arranged.

37:23.800 --> 37:25.360
We've asked Lianxiu to take
the wedding gown to the Buddhist Hall.

37:36.880 --> 37:38.480
Before you left for Qingzhou,

37:38.560 --> 37:40.240
you promised the Empress
that upon your return,

37:40.320 --> 37:42.080
you would lay down your armor
and change into wedding attire.

37:42.880 --> 37:44.240
The Empress
had been looking forward to it.

37:45.560 --> 37:48.720
Upon hearing that you would return
after winning a great victory,

37:48.800 --> 37:51.320
the Empress sought an auspicious day
for completing the needlework,

37:53.240 --> 37:54.120
but it ended up

37:55.360 --> 37:57.640
being the day of Her Majesty's funeral.

38:00.000 --> 38:02.320
To fulfill your promise to the Empress,

38:02.840 --> 38:05.800
you wore wedding attire
on the day of the funeral.

38:06.840 --> 38:09.120
Why didn't you explain it,

38:09.720 --> 38:11.840
letting His Majesty misunderstand
that you were disrespectful to her?

38:11.920 --> 38:14.600
His Majesty even doesn't permit you
to publicly mourn Her Majesty.

38:19.560 --> 38:22.480
My father would only believe
what he wishes to.

38:23.680 --> 38:24.920
So did my mother.

38:30.720 --> 38:31.840
You may leave.

38:32.680 --> 38:34.280
I want to be alone.

38:44.920 --> 38:45.880
Mother,

38:46.920 --> 38:48.760
your son, the mass murderer,

38:50.000 --> 38:51.080
is back.

38:53.080 --> 38:54.320
I guess you didn't expect it.

38:56.000 --> 38:59.920
The mass murderer could come back.

39:01.320 --> 39:03.520
Do not point blades at the people.

39:04.480 --> 39:06.760
These were your teachings, Mother.

39:07.360 --> 39:08.520
But why,

39:09.320 --> 39:11.440
even until your death,
did you refuse to trust me?

39:11.520 --> 39:13.520
You still begged for me.
You admitted fault on my behalf.

39:18.840 --> 39:20.000
I was wrong.

39:21.520 --> 39:23.040
My mistake was being merciful.

39:24.720 --> 39:26.440
For ten years…

39:26.520 --> 39:27.640
For ten years,

39:28.160 --> 39:30.800
I have been regretting my mercy.

39:32.840 --> 39:34.440
Who is it?

39:47.520 --> 39:49.480
My lord, it's a wild cat.

39:54.560 --> 39:56.480
If it's a vengeful wild cat,

39:57.760 --> 39:59.040
it would be troublesome.

40:01.440 --> 40:04.000
ZHANG MANSION

40:06.920 --> 40:07.960
My Lord, look.

40:11.320 --> 40:13.600
Your intention to have these guards
build support for the Crown Prince

40:13.680 --> 40:15.160
was well-meaning,

40:15.240 --> 40:16.320
but unexpectedly,

40:16.400 --> 40:19.200
Prince Jing managed to use it against you.

40:21.320 --> 40:23.240
Shall we report this
to the Eastern Palace?

40:24.960 --> 40:25.920
No.

40:26.760 --> 40:30.280
These bodies do not bear the mark
of Zhang Mansion.

40:31.680 --> 40:34.400
Prince Jing merely sent a few corpses
to vent his anger,

40:34.480 --> 40:36.880
which proves he can't do much to me.

40:37.680 --> 40:40.520
Why should I seek trouble
with the Crown Prince then?

40:45.320 --> 40:48.600
Get rid of these troubles.

40:48.680 --> 40:50.160
Yes. Hurry up.

41:06.160 --> 41:07.000
Who is it?

41:19.200 --> 41:20.520
My lord?

41:22.520 --> 41:24.160
This room is good.

41:25.240 --> 41:27.360
It makes it convenient for me
to sneak in at night.

41:28.160 --> 41:29.600
I dare not covet you anymore.

41:40.040 --> 41:42.800
You started this game.

41:43.320 --> 41:47.600
Now, it's not your turn to end it.

41:51.840 --> 41:53.240
Sooner or later, I will be your woman.

41:54.320 --> 41:56.480
Why don't you wait
until after the alliance banquet?

41:56.560 --> 41:58.200
I can wait,

41:59.520 --> 42:03.000
but I don't want to.

42:31.720 --> 42:34.520
I see you are wearing little.

42:35.560 --> 42:36.800
I'm afraid you may catch a cold.

42:37.880 --> 42:39.040
So,

42:40.000 --> 42:41.880
I'll warm your bed for you.

42:45.200 --> 42:46.120
It's warm.

42:56.880 --> 42:58.200
When I was little,

42:59.880 --> 43:01.560
I was burnt by fire.

43:03.560 --> 43:04.800
I'm afraid of fire,

43:07.600 --> 43:08.760
but I'm not afraid of the cold.

43:19.960 --> 43:21.320
What about you?

43:32.560 --> 43:33.760
What a coincidence!

43:33.840 --> 43:38.160
The same as you, I'm afraid of fire.

43:44.200 --> 43:45.880
Wild cats are running around.

43:48.120 --> 43:50.680
It's alright they wake you up.

43:51.360 --> 43:54.880
Be careful not to lose your life.

44:09.840 --> 44:13.840
Mother, your son,
the mass murderer, is back.

44:14.520 --> 44:16.920
The Weibei Army has strict discipline

44:17.000 --> 44:19.640
and never turns their weapons
on the people.

44:19.720 --> 44:23.000
So, they incited ignorant civilians
to besiege the military camp

44:23.080 --> 44:24.880
and even broke Prince Jing's legs.

44:25.400 --> 44:27.840
Should those misled civilians
be held accountable

44:27.920 --> 44:29.360
and admit their guilt?

44:34.240 --> 44:37.080
WEIBEI

44:41.080 --> 44:42.440
WEIBEI

44:52.280 --> 44:53.760
The noise is different.

45:05.640 --> 45:06.800
Master of the Shadow Works.

45:57.040 --> 45:58.480
Greetings, Master.

45:59.960 --> 46:02.800
You acted on your own

46:02.880 --> 46:04.440
and betrayed the Shadow Works.

46:04.520 --> 46:06.760
You should meet your end.

46:30.600 --> 46:34.440
The alliance banquet tomorrow
is your last chance.

46:35.280 --> 46:37.800
Momai poison is about to take effect.

46:37.880 --> 46:39.880
Without the antidote,

46:39.960 --> 46:42.440
you will die in three days.

46:53.160 --> 46:54.040
Yes,

46:55.960 --> 46:56.800
Master.

47:34.760 --> 47:35.680
My lord,

47:36.640 --> 47:37.800
is she the wild cat?

47:39.040 --> 47:40.560
Even if it's not her,

47:41.400 --> 47:43.200
I can't try my luck.

47:44.800 --> 47:46.200
I've been planning for ten years.

47:47.160 --> 47:51.360
It's just based on her hatred
for the mass murderer.

47:53.760 --> 47:55.360
We must win.

47:58.960 --> 48:01.920
Only you have cultivated a killer

48:02.520 --> 48:03.800
to kill you yourself.

48:06.240 --> 48:09.600
An attempted assassination in the court
will only lead to her execution.

48:10.960 --> 48:12.840
Only the orphan of Qingzhou

48:12.920 --> 48:16.160
is determined to die with me.

48:18.040 --> 48:19.600
After the plan is carried out,

48:19.680 --> 48:22.520
give her a grand burial
according to the custom of Qingzhou.

48:32.760 --> 48:34.200
Little beggar,

48:35.560 --> 48:36.840
I will

48:38.320 --> 48:40.200
avenge you.
